WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:03.730
After finding out that Kain,

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:08.010
Muhika and even Shachi had betrayed them,

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:11.110
the head of the school decided to fight the <i>Chikyo</i> sect.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:16.990
He organized small groups of warriors and departed from the Shichi School.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.200
You!

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.000
Kaiunho!

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.970
Stars cut through the skies

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:58.340
With fate in tow, they draw an arc.

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:03.240
A power that sleeps amid an endless history

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:10.480
Will be tested now.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:16.950
Time relentlessly turns everything into the past.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:22.780
Just keep laughing it off... until you lose the ability to feel!

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:26.320
Kick all limitations aside

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:29.360
come now, take your stand!

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:33.940
Draw your honed blade, abandon all hesitation...

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.690
and let your life burn bright!

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:11.920
Settling The Dispute

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:11.940
I see you've improved, Bunho.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:15.540
But it's not okay to just look forward.

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:23.790
Why are you here?

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:25.420
We'll talk more later.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:36.630
You were provoking me to buy yourself some time!?

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:41.640
I won't let you get away!

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:02.270
Was that the <i>Chimyakuhonten Technique?</i>

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.660
No, that can't be it.

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:10.870
Not even a <i>kintan can easily use such a technique.</i>

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:13.950
It's capable of moving mountains and parting seas.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.580
There's no way such a young <i>shuushi</i> can do that.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:22.110
So this can only be an illusion created by his <i>reiki</i>.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:27.340
Your illusion is nothing,

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:30.310
I can destroy this area using my power.

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:34.740
But there's an easier way...

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:39.690
If you defeat the caster it will simply break the spell, right?

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:43.290
Let me show you the true power of a <i>kyotan</i>.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.250
Shichisen <i>kenpo</i> first form, Shooting Blade.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.510
Shichisen <i>kenpo</i> second form, Clone blade.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:31.950
Shichisen <i>kenpo</i> third form, Thrusting Blade.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:57.690
Now to finish you off.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.990
Shichisen <i>kenpo</i> forth form.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.280
Tornado Blade!

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:35.480
Hmph, pathetic...

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.480
Kain!

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.950
Using him as your last trump card...

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:51.220
Are you still trying to buy time using such dirty tricks?!

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:53.920
Show yourself, you coward!

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:03.920
Congratulations.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:06.200
I see you finally came.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:10.340
But I wonder if you still have enough strength to fight me.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:14.810
Even if I only had 20-30% of my power left,

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:19.840
defeating a <i>renki</i> like you would still be a piece of cake.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:42.590
Take them away.

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.350
Kaiunho.

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:00.640
He was one of the devotees that joined with me.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.060
I see...

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:09.680
Did you not see Rei?

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.240
She's not here.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.450
It seems like there are reinforcements heading this way.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:15.900
She said she was going to go beat them up.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.350
Oh, okay.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:21.360
I think Oriku's still fighting.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:22.810
Can you go help him?

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.120
Understood.

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:03.290
Hmph, so much for being from a renowned sect.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:06.990
I'm sure you created this sect with its support as well, didn't you.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:15.300
I'll make sure nothing else comes out of that impudent mouth of yours.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.570
The facilities were all...

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.310
erected by everyone.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:36.490
I only drew the plan.

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.990
By themselves?!

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:44.110
There are even some who reached
<i>tantai</i> in a month's worth of training.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:50.500
And the smarter ones were even able to join the <i>inki</i>.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:54.240
Hmph, that's clearly the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique.

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:04.060
Reliable as always, Ryanshuu-<i>chan</i>.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.780
This guy...

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:10.520
he's absorbing the surrounding <i>reiki
and using it to increase his own power.</i>

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:13.250
Unless he's a chikuki,

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:16.530
the amount of <i>reiki that his body has taken in should have blown him up.</i>

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:21.580
His mental training is lacking but his body is abnormally tough.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:25.640
I'll have to get serious.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:36.490
I really think it's impressive that you,

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:41.220
being a <i>renki</i>,
were able to fight this long.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:54.230
However, I'm putting an end to this.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.930
Kaiunho!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.310
Hmph, one of your friends I see.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.370
One after the other.

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:30.480
Fine, I'll take care of you first then.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:33.560
Don't Kai-<i>chan</i>, he's...

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:47.000
He's above you!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.080
Be gone, you small fry!

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:04.260
Why do you keep throwing
sacrifices at me to lower my power?

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:15.270
Do as you please.
If you still want to play, I'll continue.

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:35.650
The Essence and Blood Boiling Technique
burns away one's life-span.

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:38.880
What do you think will happen when your followers find out about that?

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:41.320
Hmph, don't make me laugh.

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:45.390
Anyone that chooses the path of enlightenment
becomes aware of that.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.770
So even though they know, they still...

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:56.850
Many people, just like you,
misunderstand this method!

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:59.580
You only see the surface,
the cost which is life-span.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:01.900
You haven't grasped the essence of it.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.240
Essence?

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:07.070
What the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique
burns away is not life-span...

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:08.500
It's blood!

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:12.370
They're concentrating on the path to enlightenment,

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.080
so they can ascend and not on their life-span.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:20.110
It's the blood that gets burned
when they decide to give up everything.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:21.760
That's what the Blood Boiling is!

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:29.340
For the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique,

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:31.490
the most important thing is the ability
to stick to training and enthusiasm.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:36.260
Only those who have reached that stage
are able to experience true divine skill.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:45.050
They've gone that far!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:49.230
How much power do you think they've gained
in exchange for a year's worth of life-span?!

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:55.020
There's no way money-grabbing people
like you would understand!

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:27.590
He's not an opponent you can fight
single handed, you know.

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.730
You're late.

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:58.500
You're conscious again, aren't you?

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.840
If my intuition proves me right,

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:07.560
there was a time when you too practiced
the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:08.750
Am I wrong?

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:14.700
What was your ideology?

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:19.590
I wonder what it was...

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:24.370
Maybe I've forgotten.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:28.150
Then it just means it was that weak.

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:31.460
Hey, you over there.

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:32.970
Yeah, you.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:34.450
Ah, yes?

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:37.950
What is the reason you train?

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.440
To become enlightened and for the world.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.960
Thank you, you can step back now.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:49.640
Hmph, I really don't understand.

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:54.970
Why are they so passionate when they had
no connection to the path of enlightenment before?

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.400
Because it's their ideal.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.120
Ideal?

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:01.150
And the result.

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:05.480
They have experienced the results of training better than anyone.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:11.460
Even if it's just a small step,
its still a start to the path of enlightenment.

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:19.500
To them who were destined to only live an ordinary life,
this is very motivating.

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:27.620
The word ideal might sound good,
but to me it only seems like they've been fed a convenient lie.

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:31.670
Each one decides what they want to believe in.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:37.910
As long as that belief helps them improve,
it doesn't really matter wether it is true or not.

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:48.630
I ask you again.

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:50.530
Will you join the <i>Chikyou</i>?

00:16:53.650 --> 00:17:00.050
When I was practicing the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique
I burnt away ten years of my life.

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:02.150
However...

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:10.090
Please let me think about it.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.810
Nope.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:16.150
It's wasteful to spend time thinking about something which you already know the answer to.

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:19.430
Hmph, you're so impatient.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:27.560
Why did you have to die before your parents...

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:36.070
This was when I was asked by my senior to go and deliver correspondence to the Human Effort Temple.

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:41.030
I heard that the <i>Shichisei</i> School,

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:44.860
a minor sect, was quarreling with a newly created sect.

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:50.940
And that that sect was progressing at an extraordinary rate.

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:53.740
So I was a bit curious.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.850
Who would have known that you were its founder?

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:01.490
I know people like you.

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:04.350
Bold and proactive.

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:09.770
However, whether what you're doing is right or not...

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.480
That, I don't know.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:18.270
That's fine, you're welcome to stay and observe a bit longer.

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:20.490
I have no intentions of hiding anything.

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:24.790
I'll be doing exactly that.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.410
Since then a month has passed.

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:35.220
The head of the Shichisei School, Youshojin,
gathered all the elders and left to <i>Chikyou</i>.

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:37.310
From this point on,

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:40.630
villages that were once under the control of the Shichisei School

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:44.210
would now come under the influence of the <i>Chikyou</i> sect.

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:50.730
Oriku built a <i>houdan</i>  where
the Shichisei School's headquarters once was.

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:55.260
He named it the "Gale <i>Houdan</i>" mobile version.

00:18:57.760 --> 00:19:05.260
The two <i>houdan</i> simultaneously provided resources,
and the growth of the <i>Chikyou</i> sect quickly accelerated.

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:13.240
As they made quick progress,
disputes with various other sects was unavoidable.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:17.550
When that happened,
Youshojin and Shachi were sent to negotiate.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:23.550
However, not all negotiations went smoothly.

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:42.510
As always, thank you so much.

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:47.080
There are a lot more stores now but
the meat buns here are still the best.

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:51.840
It's been half a year since the <i>Chikyou</i> sect was established.

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:56.550
The number of followers rose to a million

00:19:56.550 --> 00:20:01.090
and it became something that
the government of China could no longer overlook.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:07.600
Bunho was put in a supervising role,
overseeing the engineering of the foundation works.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:14.600
It's not the best job, but it's important
to support the <i>reiki</i> in the area as well as the workforce.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:18.990
My strength has been steadily been
increasing this past half year.

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:21.870
I think I'll soon be able to advance from the <i>renki level.</i>

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:24.860
So, this is where you are.

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.620
The founder is calling for you.

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.620
This is something only you can do.

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.310
A letter of negotiations for the Great Republic of China?!

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:34.620
Me?!

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:37.250
Chief of the architecture department.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:42.420
True, it's a bit crazy to appoint you
a diplomatic envoy all of a sudden, but...

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:45.320
I'm sure you'll do a great job.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:47.190
No way!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:49.360
Go perform a miracle for us, young grasshopper.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:00.150
What are you going to do now?

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:03.610
Are you planning on staying as the founder
of the <i>Chikyou</i> clan forever?

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:06.860
I'm doing all this for the trial.

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:08.950
There's no way I'm abandoning my main occupation.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:13.580
My goal isn't to gather people's intelligence tax.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.790
It's to train.

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:15.880
I guess you're right.

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:18.290
But what are you doing about the <i>Chikyou</i>?

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.960
Are you telling the superiors about it?

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:22.050
Of course not...

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.310
If they find out about it, I'm dead.

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:26.130
Yeah, I guess so.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:34.800
Oriku's deception skills are exceptional, but...

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:37.050
since he's used the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:39.640
there's no way the 10,000 Enlightened Alliance will accept it.

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:43.900
The same goes for the Great Republic of China.

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:50.790
Don't you think this errand is a bit too much for Bunho?

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:52.450
He'll be fine.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:54.230
Why do you say that?

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:55.660
Because...

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:59.420
that's the awoken Bunho.

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:00.740
Huh?

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:36.390
A wind blowing through this valley

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:42.820
Carries a new season along with it.

00:22:43.640 --> 00:22:49.340
Amid days that seemed stuck on repeat,

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:55.140
I found a piece of happiness.

00:22:56.100 --> 00:23:02.240
Twinkling days that were spent chasing a dream

00:23:02.430 --> 00:23:08.730
Disappeared into the past, leaving memories behind.

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:14.860
But my dreams turn this unyielding passion

00:23:15.020 --> 00:23:21.950
Into a newfound strength.

00:23:45.590 --> 00:23:49.990
Next time

00:23:45.590 --> 00:23:49.990
The Ravine of Blood Clouds
